75. Gemini — Ultra Short Rule

يمكن وضع هذه النسخة في بداية أي Prompt موجه إلى Gemini:

SMART HALAQA — DESIGN SYSTEM RULE

Before creating or modifying any file:

1. Reuse existing Components first.
2. Reuse UI styles from src/theme/styles.js.
3. Reuse CSS/Tailwind semantic tokens.
4. Never hardcode colors when a token exists.
5. Never create a parallel theme or design system.
6. Preserve Cairo typography.
7. Preserve RTL/LTR behavior.
8. Preserve i18n.
9. Preserve responsive behavior.
10. Preserve existing functionality and APIs.
11. Make global design changes centrally.
12. Make the smallest safe change necessary.
13. Do not invent new colors, shadows, radii, buttons, inputs, or cards without a real requirement.
14. Any new reusable visual rule belongs in the central Design System.
15. Every new component must visually belong to Smart Halaqa.

Core Principle

REUSE → EXTEND CENTRALLY → IMPLEMENT

NOT:

INVENT → DUPLICATE → OVERRIDE
